  scriptedFlavorTexts:
  - The bears bring their claws down from above.
  - "The bears rapidly swing their claws at Natsuki.\t"
  - "The bears swing at Natsuki with the force of a dragon.\t"
  - "The bears start shedding while they swing at Natsuki.\t"
  - The bears fling beehives at Natsuki?!?
  - More beehives fall from above, releasing angry bees.
  - The bears pick up the beehives from the floor, flinging them at Natsuki again.
  - The bees now swarm at Natsuki angrily.
  randomAttacks:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7aab6213b77b81b4c8f41bcdd20957cd, type: 2}
