  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9bceeb79b677eb8469d8b938f53a5cf0, type: 2}
  randomFlavorTexts:
  - The bears get back on their hind legs and bring their claws down.
  - The bears rapidly swing their claws at Natsuki. Again.
  - The bears coordinate their swings once more. Scoundrels...
  - The bears start shedding again. (They should consider a barber.)
  - The second bear pulls out a bow and starts shooting arrows... (What?!?)
  - The angry swarm of bees charge back into battle. Those punks!
  maxHealth: 150
